nethack.rankin@eql.caltech.edu explains that I may distribute my bastardized
version of NetHack.  Yea!  OK.  Here is a summary of my changes:

+ Smart pets. (Pets won't walk directly into your path)
+ Confirm walking into water.
+ Can ID and wish for "rustproof" things.
+ Spellbooks completely re-hashed.
  (Wizards and Priests get perks.  Spells learned forever. More expensive.)
+ Arrows do proper if shot from a bow.
+ Many artifact changes:
  - Stormbringer now a long sword, regenerates you if it draws life.
    No friendly or safe-pet warnings if you wield Stormbringer
  - Glossporina = shocking long sword (protects from drain level)
  - Characters get artifact of their alignment by #dipping a long sword
  - All artifacts have special hit messages.
+ Any character may get Priest's "enchantment perception" ability.
+ Eating certain monsters may affects stats. (Minotaur / Lich / Unicorn)
+ Only throwing real gems to unicorns will affect your luck. Glass never will.
+ Many MacOS changes 
+ "Big" level much more common.

Anybody who wants, can have my modified sources.  Anybody with a mac, can
have my executable.  I think it's a fun twist.

